O004
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000 line:8% position:50% size:94% align:center
[On screen] In 1965, the Vietnam War reached the
hills of Laos. Long Tieng Airbase enabled the
U.S. to conduct covert operations in Asia.

S003
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
We moved to Long Tieng between 1964-65.

S004
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:21.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
At that time Long Tieng had only a small old
airport.

S005
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:27.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
In 1965, they built a long airstrip and
expanded.

S006
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
The Hmong were forced to leave in 1975.

S007
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:39.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
To Vientiane, to the mountains, anywhere.

S008
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:46.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
Some Hmong crossed the Mekong to Thailand.

S009
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
America and France accepted the Hmong refugees.

S010
00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:01.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
They went to France and America, to French
Guiana and Australia.

O005
00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.000 line:8% position:50% size:94% align:center
[On screen] SONG HER / 18 T-42552

O006
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:15.000 line:8% position:50% size:94% align:center
[On screen] Tens of thousands left their homes,
fields & families.

S011
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:33.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
I was very happy, because one of the latest KMs
had mentioned working with foreign-speaking
people moving into America.

O007
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.000 line:8% position:50% size:94% align:center
[On screen] Arriving and Resettling in America /
1979

S012
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:38.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
And I felt at the time that I was witnessing a
fulfillment of a scripture that I read

S013
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
