from all over the world.

S014
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:48.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
And that's exactly what he was doing, and I was
happy to see that.

O008
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:49.000 line:8% position:50% size:94% align:center
[On screen] Getting to Know Jehovah's People /
1980

S015
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:09.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
For myself I was very happy, but then I was a
little astonished too.

O009
