people in the neighborhood.

S018
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:27.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
More people! Yes, and they were praising
Jehovah, and teaching the truth to their friends
and their family and the whole neighborhood.

S019
00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.000 line:78% position:50% size:94% align:center
It was just amazing. And I'm speaking from my
heart.

